				"type": "markup",
				"description": "The component's markup is a recorded-runtime-evidence section; a ready result shows current/commit scope and RegressionProof, while an offline workspace labels the copy as saved and not server-checked, adding its cache time when available. A notice takes precedence over audio, screens, and behavior; without a notice, audio renders for every ready result, screens render for non-functions that are visual or have screen options, and behavior renders for nonvisual entities or when behavior rows exist."
